## PHẦN 2: TRIGGER MATRIX

### 2.1 Keyword → Skill Mapping

> **Source:** Based on [addyosmani/agent-skills](https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills) - Production-grade engineering skills

| Keyword / Pattern | Primary Skill | Confidence | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| **LIFECYCLE COMMANDS (agent-skills)** ||||
| `spec`, `/spec` | spec-driven-development | 0.95 | Write PRD before code |
| `plan`, `/plan` | planning-and-task-breakdown | 0.95 | Atomic task breakdown |
| `build`, `/build` | incremental-implementation | 0.95 | Thin vertical slices |
| `test`, `/test` | test-driven-development | 0.95 | TDD with proof |
| `review`, `/review` | code-review-and-quality | 0.95 | Five-axis review |
| `webperf`, `/webperf` | performance-optimization | 0.95 | Core Web Vitals |
| `code-simplify` | code-simplification | 0.90 | Chesterton's Fence |
| `ship`, `/ship` | shipping-and-launch | 0.95 | Pre-launch checklist |
| `interview` | interview-me | 0.90 | One-question-at-a-time |
| **VISUAL** ||||
| `diagram` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | Architecture/system diagrams |
| `architecture overview` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | System architecture |
| `flowchart` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | Process flows |
| `diff review` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | Visual diff review |
| `plan review` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | Plan vs code comparison |
| `slide deck` | visual-explainer | 0.95 | Presentation slides |
| `project recap` | visual-explainer | 0.90 | Mental model snapshot |
| **FRONTEND - Landing** ||||
| `landing page` | frontend-taste + Hallmark | 0.95 | Landing/hero pages + 20 themes |
