## 10. HALLMARK ANTI-SLOP DESIGN SKILL (sync 2026-07-16)

> **Source:** [Nutlope/hallmark](https://github.com/Nutlope/hallmark) (9.3k stars, MIT License) — Anti-AI-slop design skill for Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex.
