### 10.1 Tổng quan

Hallmark picks a **macrostructure** for the brief, dresses it in one of **twenty themes**, runs **fifty-seven slop-test gates** plus a **pre-emit self-critique**, and refuses the on-distribution defaults every LLM was trained into.

