| `hallmark redesign` | Throw out the structure, keep copy + IA + brand, rebuild with a different fingerprint. | `frontend-redesign` |
| `hallmark study` | Extract the **DNA** from a design you admire: macrostructure, type-pairing, colour anchor. | `ui-visual-design.mdc` |

