### 10.5 Routing Layer Integration

Marketing security triggers sẽ tự động augment routing decisions trong `context_router.py`:

```python
# Pseudo-code logic (in context_router.py)
def route_request(user_query: str):
    base_skill = classify_marketing_skill(user_query)  # existing
    security_severity = detect_security_severity(user_query)
    
    if security_severity == 'CRITICAL':
        # Block or require security-auditor review
        return [security_auditor, base_skill]
    elif security_severity == 'HIGH':
        # Recommend security review before proceeding
        return [security_auditor, base_skill, full_output]
    elif security_severity == 'MEDIUM':
        # Append security best-practice to context
        return [base_skill, security_best_practice_ref]
    else:
        return [base_skill]
```

